      "statement": "The user-controllable 'c' URL param is validated against CHUNK_SIZE_OPTIONS (8/16/32/64/128 KB, the same single source of truth the sender options UI offers); NaN, 0, negative, or non-listed values all fall back to the 32 KB default chunk size.",
